WEBVTT - fixed sample for round-trip tests

NOTE
This file is a fixed WebVTT sample used by the pysubs2 test suite.
It exercises NOTE/STYLE/REGION blocks, cue identifiers, cue settings
and HTML character references.

REGION
id:top
width:40%
lines:3
regionanchor:0%,0%
viewportanchor:10%,10%
scroll:up

STYLE
::cue(b) {
  color: lime;
}

intro
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.500 align:start position:10%
Hello &amp; welcome world

NOTE a note between two cues

middle
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.000 line:80% align:middle
Second &amp; cue with <i>italics</i>

trailer
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.250 region:top
Third &amp; cue in a region

NOTE
trailing note after the last cue

